irectory -Path $t | Out-Null\n 209→try {\n 210→  Copy-Item -Recurse test, contracts -Destination $t\n 211→  Set-Content -Path (Join-Path $t 'test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/README.md') -Value 'x' -Encoding utf8NoBOM\n 212→  $out = (node scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs --root $t 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 213→  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n 214→  if ($code -ne 1) { throw \"expected exit code 1, got $code\" }\n 215→  if (-not $out.Contains('FAIL frozen.unregistered test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/README.md')) { throw 'missing frozen.unregistered line' }\n 216→} finally {\n 217→  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n 218→}\n 219→'B5 OK'\n 220→exit 0\n 221→```\n 222→\n 223→- 退出码 1；stdout 含 `FAIL frozen.unregistered test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/README.md`。\n 224→\n 225→### B6 未知参数\n 226→\n 227→```powershell\n 228→$out = (node scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs --bogus 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 229→$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n 230→if ($code -ne 2) { throw \"expected exit code 2, got $code\" }\n 231→'B6 OK'\n 232→exit 0\n 233→```\n 234→\n 235→- 退出码 2，stderr 含 `unknown argument: --bogus`。\n 236→\n 237→## 3. stable.test.mjs 只依赖副本\n 238→\n 239→### C1 所有相对 import 都指向副本\n 240→\n 241→```powershell\n 242→$out = (node -e \"const s=require('fs').readFileSync('test/characterization/stable.test.mjs','utf8');const specs=[...s.matchAll(/(?:from\\s*|import\\s*\\(\\s*)[\\x27\\x22](\\.[^\\x27\\x22]*)[\\x27\\x22]/g)].map(m=>m[1]);const ok=specs.length>=2&&specs.every(x=>x.includes('fixtures/characterization/v0.1/'))&&!/[\\x27\\x22]\\.\\.\\/\\.\\.\\/(lib|bin|scripts)\\//.test(s);console.log(ok?'ok '+specs.length:'FAIL '+JSON.stringify(specs));process.exit(ok?0:1)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 243→$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n 244→if ($code -ne 0) { throw \"import check exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\n 245→if ($out.Trim() -notmatch '^ok \\d+$') { throw \"unexpected output: '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n 246→'C1 OK'\n 247→exit 0\n 248→```\n 249→\n 250→- 退出码 0，stdout 匹配 `^ok \\d+$`（相对 import 数量 ≥ 2，且每个都含 `fixtures/characterization/v0.1/`）。\n 251→\n 252→### C2 保留面是真的被锁住的：把副本里的排除原因改坏，stable 必须失败\n 253→\n 254→```powershell\n 255→$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-stable-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\n 256→New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\n 257→try {\n 258→  Copy-Item -Recurse test, scripts, package.json, contracts -Destination $t\n 259→  $f = Join-Path $t 'test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/lib/select.mjs'\n 260→  (Get-Content -Raw $f).Replace(\"reason: 'excluded'\", \"reason: 'not_excluded'\") | Set-Content -NoNewline -Path $f -Encoding utf8NoBOM\n 261→  $out = (node --test (Join-Path $t 'test/characterization/stable.test.mjs') 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 262→  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n 263→  if ($code -eq 0) { throw 'stable.test.mjs still passed on the broken copy' }\n 264→  $cross = [string][char]0x2716\n 265→  $hit = $out.Contains('stable: exclude wins and reports excluded')\n 266→  if (-not $hit) { throw 'the exclude test did not run' }\n 267→  if (-not (($out -match 'not ok') -or $out.Contains($cross))) { throw 'no failure line reported' }\n 268→} finally {\n 269→  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n 270→}\n 271→'C2 OK'\n 272→exit 0\n 273→```\n 274→\n 275→- 在临时副本上做，不动仓库。\n 276→- 退出码 1；输出含 `[AC-005] stable: exclude wins and reports excluded` 且带 `not ok`（或 `✖`）。\n 277→\n 278→## 4. 缺陷账本\n 279→\n 280→### D1 defects.json 恰好 11 条，字段与取值正确\n 281→\n 282→```powershell\n 283→$out = (node -e \"const j=require('./test/characterization/defects.json');const exp={'a1-quota':['T-006','M1','AC-015'],'a2-pack':['T-009','M1','AC-025'],'a3-runner':['T-001','M1','AC-001'],'a4-paths':['T-005','M1','AC-012'],'a4-null-config':['T-005','M1','AC-014'],'a5-dup-call':['T-007','M1','AC-020'],'a5-forecast-x3':['T-007','M1','AC-020'],'a5-unused':['T-007','M1','AC-022'],'a5-ignored-fields':['T-008','M1','AC-024'],'a5-shell':['T-010','M2','AC-026'],'a5-nocache':['T-022','M4','AC-055']};const d=j.defects;let bad=[];if(d.length!==11)bad.push('count '+d.length);for(const x of d){const e=exp[x.id];if(!e){bad.push('unknown '+x.id);continue}if(x.owner_task!==e[0]||x.owner_milestone!==e[1]||x.ac!==e[2])bad.push('fields '+x.id);if(!/^[0-9a-f]{64}$/.test(x.repro_sha256))bad.push('sha '+x.id)}if(new Set(d.map(x=>x.id)).size!==11)bad.push('dup');console.log(bad.length?'FAIL '+bad.join(';'):'ok 11');process.exit(bad.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 284→$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n 285→if ($code -ne 0) { throw \"defects.json check exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\n 286→if ($out.Trim() -ne 'ok 11') { throw \"expected 'ok 11', got '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n 287→'D1 OK'\n 288→exit 0\n 289→```\n 290→\n 291→- 退出码 0，stdout 恰为 `ok 11`。\n 292→- 每条含 `id`、`owner_task`、`owner_milestone`、`ac`、`repro_sha256`（64 位小写十六进制），id 不重复。\n 293→\n 294→### D2 每条缺陷都有 repro 文件、canary 与合法的 canary.json，且 canary 目录里没有 `*.test.mjs`\n 295→\n 296→```powershell\n 297→$out = (node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const ids=require('./test/characterization/defects.json').defects.map(x=>x.id);let bad=[];for(const id of ids){if(!fs.existsSync('test/characterization/defects/'+id+'.test.mjs'))bad.push('repro '+id);const f='test/characterization/canary/'+id+'/canary.json';if(!fs.existsSync(f)){bad.push('canary '+id);continue}const c=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(f,'utf8'));const hasOverlay=fs.existsSync('test/characterization/canary/'+id+'/overlay');if(c.defect!==id||!(hasOverlay||(Array.isArray(c.repro_edits)&&c.repro_edits.length>0)))bad.push('shape '+id)}(function w(d){for(const e of fs.readdirSync(d,{withFileTypes:true})){const p=d+'/'+e.name;if(e.isDirectory())w(p);else if(e.name.endsWith('.test.mjs'))bad.push('testfile '+p)}})('test/characterization/canary');console.log(bad.length?'FAIL '+bad.join(';'):'ok');process.exit(bad.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 298→$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n 299→if ($code -ne 0) { throw \"defect assets check exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\n 300→if ($out.Trim() -ne 'ok') { throw \"expected 'ok', got '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n 301→'D2 OK'\n 302→exit 0\n 303→```\n 304→\n 305→- 退出码 0，stdout 恰为 `ok`。\n 306→- 11 条都有 `<id>.test.mjs` 与 `canary/<id>/canary.json`；`canary.json` 的 `defect` 等于目录名，且有 overlay 目录或非空 `repro_edits`。\n 307→\n 308→### D3 [repro] 与 [fixed] 分离\n 309→\n 310→```powershell\n 311→$out = (node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const ids=require('./test/characterization/defects.json').defects.map(x=>x.id).filter(x=>x!=='a3-runner');let bad=[];for(const id of ids){const s=fs.readFileSync('test/characterization/defects/'+id+'.test.mjs','utf8').replace(/\\r\\n/g,'\\n');const opens=s.split('\\n').filter(l=>/^test\\([\\x27\\x22]\\[repro\\]/.test(l));if(opens.length<1)bad.push('norepro '+id);if(opens.some(l=>!/\\{\\s*$/.test(l)))bad.push('open '+id);if(/\\[fixed\\]/.test(s))bad.push('fixed '+id);if(!/^\\}\\)$/m.test(s))bad.push('close '+id);if(!s.includes('CLIWORKER_V01_ROOT'))bad.push('root '+id)}console.log(bad.length?'FAIL '+bad.join(';'):'ok '+ids.length);process.exit(bad.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 312→$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n 313→if ($code -ne 0) { throw \"repro section check exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\n 314→if ($out.Trim() -ne 'ok 10') { throw \"expected 'ok 10', got '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n 315→'D3 OK'\n 316→exit 0\n 317→```\n 318→\n 319→- 退出码 0，stdout 恰为 `ok 10`。\n 320→- 本任务写的 10 个文件每个都有 `[repro]` 块、没有 `[fixed]` 块；块以 `{` 结尾、以行首 `})` 结束；块外定义了 `CLIWORKER_V01_ROOT`。\n 321→\n 322→### D4 篡改 [repro] 段 → check-defects 失败\n 323→\n 324→```powershell\n 325→$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-defects-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\n 326→New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\n 327→try {\n 328→  Copy-Item -Recurse test, contracts -Destination $t\n 329→  $f = Join-Path $t 'test/characterization/defects/a5-dup-call.test.mjs'\n 330→  (Get-Content -Raw $f) -replace '\\[repro\\]', '[repro] edited' | Set-Content -NoNewline -Path $f -Encoding utf8NoBOM\n 331→  $out = (node scripts/check-defects.mjs --root $t --strict 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 332→  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n 333→  if ($code -ne 1) { throw \"expected exit code 1, got $code\" }\n 334→  if (-not $out.Contains('FAIL defects.repro_changed a5-dup-call')) { throw 'missing defects.repro_changed line' }\n 335→} finally {\n 336→  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n 337→}\n 338→'D4 OK'\n 339→exit 0\n 340→```\n 341→\n 342→- 在临时副本上做，不动仓库。\n 343→- 退出码 1；stdout 含 `FAIL defects.repro_changed a5-dup-call`。\n 344→\n 345→### D5 canary 失效 → check-defects 失败\n 346→\n 347→```powershell\n 348→$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-defects-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\n 349→New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\n 350→try {\n 351→  Copy-Item -Recurse test, contracts -Destination $t\n 352→  Copy-Item -Force (Join-Path $t 'test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/lib/select.mjs') (Join-Path $t 'test/characterization/canary/a5-dup-call/overlay/lib/select.mjs')\n 353→  $out = (node scripts/check-defects.mjs --root $t --strict 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 354→  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n 355→  if ($code -ne 1) { throw \"expected exit code 1, got $code\" }\n 356→  if (-not $out.Contains('FAIL defects.canary_survived a5-dup-call')) { throw 'missing defects.canary_survived line' }\n 357→  $ids = @('a1-quota','a2-pack','a3-runner','a4-paths','a4-null-config','a5-forecast-x3','a5-unused','a5-ignored-fields','a5-shell','a5-nocache')\n 358→  foreach ($id in $ids) { if ($out.Contains(\"defects.canary_survived $id\")) { throw \"unexpected canary_survived for $id\" } }\n 359→} finally {\n 360→  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n 361→}\n 362→'D5 OK'\n 363→exit 0\n 364→```\n 365→\n 366→- 把 `a5-dup-call` 的 overlay 换回未修复的 0.1 原文。\n 367→- 退出码 1；stdout 含 `FAIL defects.canary_survived a5-dup-call`；不含对其它 10 个缺陷的 `canary_survived`。\n 368→\n 369→### D6 缺少 canary → check-defects 失败\n 370→\n 371→```powershell\n 372→$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) ('cw-defects-' + [guid]::NewGuid().ToString('N'))\n 373→New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $t | Out-Null\n 374→try {\n 375→  Copy-Item -Recurse test, contracts -Destination $t\n 376→  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force (Join-Path $t 'test/characterization/canary/a4-paths')\n 377→  $out = (node scripts/check-defects.mjs --root $t --strict 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 378→  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n 379→  if ($code -ne 1) { throw \"expected exit code 1, got $code\" }\n 380→  if (-not $out.Contains('FAIL defects.canary_missing a4-paths')) { throw 'missing defects.canary_missing line' }\n 381→} finally {\n 382→  Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $t -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n 383→}\n 384→'D6 OK'\n 385→exit 0\n 386→```\n 387→\n 388→- 退出码 1；stdout 含 `FAIL defects.canary_missing a4-paths`。\n 389→\n 390→### D7 T-001 既有行为不变\n 391→\n 392→```powershell\n 393→$out = (node --test test/unit/milestone-gate.test.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 394→$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n 395→if ($code -ne 0) { throw \"milestone-gate test exited $code\" }\n 396→$cross = [string][char]0x2716\n 397→if ($out.Contains($cross)) { throw 'output contains the failure mark' }\n 398→if ($out -match '(?m)^not ok ') { throw 'output contains a failing subtest' }\n 399→'D7 OK'\n 400→exit 0\n 401→```\n 402→\n 403→- 退出码 0；不含 `✖`、不含 `not ok`。\n 404→\n 405→## 5. 追踪与范围\n 406→\n 407→### E1 追踪分片\n 408→\n 409→```powershell\n 410→$out = (node scripts/check-traceability.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 411→$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n 412→if ($code -ne 0) { throw \"check-traceability exited $code\" }\n 413→if ($out -notmatch '(?m)^check-traceability: ok \\(covered=\\d+ planned=\\d+\\)\\s*$') { throw 'unexpected check-traceability output' }\n 414→$json = (node -e \"const j=require('./test/traceability/T-002.json');const e=j.entries;const ok=Object.keys(j).sort().join()==='entries,milestone,task'&&j.task==='T-002'&&j.milestone==='M1'&&e.length===1&&e[0].ac==='AC-005'&&e[0].status==='covered'&&e[0].files.join()==='test/characterization/stable.test.mjs,test/unit/frozen-files.test.mjs';console.log(ok?'ok':'FAIL')\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 415→if ($json.Trim() -ne 'ok') { throw \"T-002.json check failed: $($json.Trim())\" }\n 416→'E1 OK'\n 417→exit 0\n 418→```\n 419→\n 420→- 退出码 0；stdout 匹配 `^check-traceability: ok \\(covered=\\d+ planned=\\d+\\)$`。\n 421→- `test/traceability/T-002.json` 的键恰为 `task`、`milestone`、`entries`，且内容为 AC-005 covered、两个测试文件。\n 422→\n 423→### E2 只写了 write_scope 内的文件\n 424→\n 425→```powershell\n 426→$diff = (git diff --name-only main...HEAD | node -e \"const re=[/^test\\/fixtures\\/characterization\\//,/^test\\/characterization\\/(stable\\.test\\.mjs|defects\\.json|frozen-files\\.json)$/,/^test\\/characterization\\/defects\\/(a1-quota|a2-pack|a4-paths|a4-null-config|a5-dup-call|a5-forecast-x3|a5-unused|a5-shell|a5-nocache|a5-ignored-fields)\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/unit\\/frozen-files\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^scripts\\/(check-frozen-files|check-defects|check-ci)\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/unit\\/traceability\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/traceability\\/T-002\\.json$/,/^test\\/characterization\\/canary\\//,/^\\.collab\\/(tasks\\/002\\/|blueprint\\/cliworker-v2\\/task-graph\\.json$)/];const out=require('fs').readFileSync(0,'utf8').split(/\\r?\\n/).filter(Boolean).filter(f=>!re.some(r=>r.test(f)));console.log(out.length?'OUT '+out.join(','):'out-of-scope: none');process.exit(out.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 427→if ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw \"diff scope check failed: $($diff.Trim())\" }\n 428→if ($diff.Trim() -ne 'out-of-scope: none') { throw \"unexpected diff scope: $($diff.Trim())\" }\n 429→$status = (git status --porcelain | node -e \"const re=[/^test\\/fixtures\\/characterization\\//,/^test\\/characterization\\/(stable\\.test\\.mjs|defects\\.json|frozen-files\\.json)$/,/^test\\/characterization\\/defects\\/(a1-quota|a2-pack|a4-paths|a4-null-config|a5-dup-call|a5-forecast-x3|a5-unused|a5-shell|a5-nocache|a5-ignored-fields)\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/unit\\/frozen-files\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^scripts\\/(check-frozen-files|check-defects|check-ci)\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/unit\\/traceability\\.test\\.mjs$/,/^test\\/traceability\\/T-002\\.json$/,/^test\\/characterization\\/canary\\//,/^\\.collab\\/tasks\\/002\\//];const out=require('fs').readFileSync(0,'utf8').split(/\\r?\\n/).filter(Boolean).map(l=>l.slice(3).replace(/^.* -> /,'').replace(/^\\\"|\\\"$/g,'')).filter(f=>!re.some(r=>r.test(f)));console.log(out.length?'OUT '+out.join(','):'dirty: in-scope only');process.exit(out.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 430→if ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { throw \"working tree scope check failed: $($status.Trim())\" }\n 431→if ($status.Trim() -ne 'dirty: in-scope only') { throw \"unexpected working tree: $($status.Trim())\" }\n 432→'E2 OK'\n 433→exit 0\n 434→```\n 435→\n 436→- `git diff --name-only main...HEAD` 里每条路径都落在 write_scope（含 task-graph 为本任务追加的 `scripts/check-ci.mjs`、`test/unit/traceability.test.mjs` 两处单行修复）或 `.collab/tasks/002/`、`.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/task-graph.json`。\n 437→- `git status --porcelain` 的输出同样只落在上述范围（不含 `test/characterization/defects/a3-runner.test.mjs`、`scripts/run-tests.mjs`、`package.json`、`lib/`、`bin/`、`config/`）。\n 438→\n 439→### E3 无第三方依赖、无令牌\n 440→\n 441→```powershell\n 442→$out = (node -e \"const fs=require('fs');const files=['scripts/check-frozen-files.mjs','scripts/check-defects.mjs','test/characterization/stable.test.mjs','test/unit/frozen-files.test.mjs'];const bad=[];for(const f of files){const s=fs.readFileSync(f,'utf8');for(const m of s.matchAll(/(?:from\\s*|import\\s*\\(\\s*|require\\(\\s*)[\\x27\\x22]([^\\x27\\x22]+)[\\x27\\x22]/g)){const x=m[1];if(!(x.startsWith('.')||x.startsWith('node:')))bad.push(f+' '+x)}if(/(sk-[A-Za-z0-9]{16,}|ghp_[A-Za-z0-9]{20,}|api[_-]?key\\s*[:=]\\s*[\\x27\\x22][^\\x27\\x22]{8,})/i.test(s))bad.push(f+' secret')}console.log(bad.length?'FAIL '+bad.join(';'):'ok');process.exit(bad.length?1:0)\" 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 443→$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n 444→if ($code -ne 0) { throw \"dependency check exited ${code}: $($out.Trim())\" }\n 445→if ($out.Trim() -ne 'ok') { throw \"expected 'ok', got '$($out.Trim())'\" }\n 446→'E3 OK'\n 447→exit 0\n 448→```\n 449→\n 450→- 退出码 0，stdout 恰为 `ok`。\n 451→- 四个文件的 import 说明符只有相对路径与 `node:` 内置模块；没有 `sk-`/`ghp_`/`api_key` 形态的令牌。\n 452→\n 453→## 6. 各缺陷 repro 的实质内容\n 454→\n 455→### F1 每条 repro 在副本上通过\n 456→\n 457→```powershell\n 458→$files = @(\n 459→  'test/characterization/defects/a1-quota.test.mjs',\n 460→  'test/characterization/defects/a2-pack.test.mjs',\n 461→  'test/characterization/defects/a3-runner.test.mjs',\n 462→  'test/characterization/defects/a4-paths.test.mjs',\n 463→  'test/characterization/defects/a4-null-config.test.mjs',\n 464→  'test/characterization/defects/a5-dup-call.test.mjs',\n 465→  'test/characterization/defects/a5-forecast-x3.test.mjs',\n 466→  'test/characterization/defects/a5-unused.test.mjs',\n 467→  'test/characterization/defects/a5-shell.test.mjs',\n 468→  'test/characterization/defects/a5-nocache.test.mjs',\n 469→  'test/characterization/defects/a5-ignored-fields.test.mjs'\n 470→)\n 471→foreach ($f in $files) {\n 472→  $out = (node --test --test-name-pattern=\"\\[repro\\]\" $f 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 473→  $code = $LASTEXITCODE\n 474→  if ($code -ne 0) { throw \"$f exited $code\" }\n 475→  if ($out -notmatch '(?m)^# fail 0\\s*$') { throw \"$f did not report fail 0\" }\n 476→  if ($out -notmatch '(?m)^# pass [1-9]\\d*\\s*$') { throw \"$f did not report a passing subtest\" }\n 477→}\n 478→'F1 OK'\n 479→exit 0\n 480→```\n 481→\n 482→- 11 个文件逐个运行，每条退出码 0，输出中 `fail 0` 且 `pass` ≥ 1。\n 483→\n 484→### F2 canary 对每个缺陷都真的命中\n 485→\n 486→```powershell\n 487→$out = (node scripts/check-defects.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String)\n 488→$code = $LASTEXITCODE\n 489→if ($code -ne 0) { throw \"check-defects exited $code\" }\n 490→foreach ($failure in @('defects.canary_survived', 'defects.canary_missing', 'defects.canary_error', 'defects.repro_baseline_failed', 'defects.repro_changed')) {\n 491→  if ($out.Contains($failure)) { throw \"stdout contains $failure\" }\n 492→}\n 493→if (-not $out.Contains('check-defects: ok')) { throw 'stdout is missing check-defects: ok' }\n 494→'F2 OK'\n 49